WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:10.320
The residents of the Oji village, deceived by the Shichi School, were now prisoners to the hope that anyone can become enlightened.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:19.820
Oriku decided that the only way to set them free from the evil sect was to create his own sect and rule over them himself.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.560
This Oji Village will be the perfect place due to it's feng shui.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.040
I've decided to build my own houdan here.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.000
And he succeeded.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.960
*Subbed by JellySubs*

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.960
*Thank you to Angela for proofreading*

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:24.840
I beg you, please bestow upon us the <i>senen</i>.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:31.680
You see, the <i>senen</i> isn't something that can simply be given to someone.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.780
Exactly.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.780
Please reconsider.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:36.080
We beg you!

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.160
Still, as long as the founder...

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:46.340
Since the <i>houdan</i> has now been built here, I don't think it appropriate to constantly reject these people's wishes.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.080
Founder...

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.040
There's no need to thank me.

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.080
It's not like I came to visit the mortal world.

00:02:55.780 --> 00:03:00.160
In three days I shall preach a sermon in front of the <i>houdan</i>.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:04.260
It will be up to you how much you learn from it.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.740
Thank you!!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:13.620
He's left.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.240
I see...

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:27.220
Got it.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.060
Please continue your investigation.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.020
Yes, sir!

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:41.650
It's been two months since brother has stopped coming to the elder meetings.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:46.800
Don't tell me... Don't tell me brother has...

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:49.680
Brother!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:57.480
So in other words, elder Kain betrayed us.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:04.340
Elder Shachi, you were friends with him for a long time, were you not?

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.740
Do you also think he's betrayed us?

00:04:06.740 --> 00:04:10.780
I don't know, when it comes to brother...

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:12.920
Then go make sure.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:19.780
If it's actually true, we will have to make him go through a lot of atonement.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.400
And I would like you to do it yourself.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.400
Is that understood?

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:31.720
I understand.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.840
Kotora, the Oji village is your hometown.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.760
What happened to your family?

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.000
I left the village by myself.

00:04:46.060 --> 00:04:48.140
My mother is still in the village.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.140
Do you want to see her?

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:51.340
No.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.060
Why is that?

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:57.160
Are you not proud that you're part of the Shichi school?

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.600
You really are dumb.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.340
Can't you even do that?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:06.360
You can't beat Oriku at anything.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:09.240
I'm gonna become a disciple of the Reiken sect.

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.540
The Reiken sect?

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:14.780
Isn't that the oldest, largest and one of the top sects there is?

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.220
I'm sure you can make it!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.080
Good luck!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:21.080
You can do it!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.880
How about you join us, the Shichi school?

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:27.880
But I have no <i>senen</i>.

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:32.060
Anyone that trains with us can become an enlightened.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.060
Really?!

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.200
I don't mind, everyone's like that.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.600
I'm the same as you.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:48.300
Me and elder Kain have known each other for more than 100 years.

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:52.920
We were both confident that we'd be able to join one of the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance Sects, however...

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:54.920
We hit a wall.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:59.460
It was then that we met the head of our school.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:03.620
And that's how we joined the Shichi school.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:09.020
Once we joined, we realized that this was a place for the failures.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:22.160
Still, I've come to think that helping others less gifted than myself gives my life that bit more value.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:30.020
It can't be said that the growth of the Shichi school these past years has been smooth sailing but,

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.180
the group itself is devoid of problems.

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:35.420
There has never been any internal conflict.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.200
You can't eat that!

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.940
Huh, you spilt it again...

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:46.520
What? You need to pee?

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.360
Dad, he...

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:51.220
Again!? It's about to start you know.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.840
Nearly all the villagers are here.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.920
They really want to become enlightened, don't they.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.860
Oriku's parents.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.860
I just hope we don't get exposed.

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:08.100
It's time.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.840
I don't want to use up your time.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:28.180
So, today I'll be talking about an important topic. The <i>senkai</i>, the world where the enlightened live.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:35.200
Everyone wants to live happily,

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.380
to live in peace,

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:39.700
to live a long prosperous life.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.600
Don't you all think that?

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.320
That exists in the <i>senkai</i>.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:48.620
There is no worldly gain nor strife.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:51.600
There's only a peaceful and calm livelihood.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:08:06.420
Firstly, as soon as the new enlightened that ascended from this world step foot in the <i>senkai</i>, they are highly praised by seventy-two nymphs of unparalleled beauty.

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:16.000
All the enlightened in <i>senkai</i> live in luxurious palaces, own vast pieces of land.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:20.920
Even the greatest kings of this world cannot compare with the lowest class enlightened.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.020
How can we become enlightened?

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.980
Do I also have potential?

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:28.260
Can anyone become enlightened?

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:40.180
Does everyone know how many levels of the celestial sphere there are above the mortal world?

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:47.420
There are a total of nine floors stacked on top of each other.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:56.580
However, these floors didn't all exist since the creation of heaven.

00:08:56.660 --> 00:09:01.640
It took many years for them to build up.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:11.320
It's lowest level, the one right above the human plane, used to be a human plane as well.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:14.580
How can he say such a lie so seriously...

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:19.980
And finally, the ones to become enlightened are you.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.460
When will that be?

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.960
In about 10 million to 20 million years.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.500
In 10 million years...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.500
We obviously can't wait that long.

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.980
The time is not exact.

00:09:35.980 --> 00:09:41.520
It all depends on how much training the person aiming for it does.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.200
Yeah, but still...

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:51.740
Once there is a total of a million ascenders in one world, that world also ascends along with them and becomes a <i>senkai</i>.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:56.680
When that happens even common people can ascend to the <i>senkai</i>.

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:05.480
Founder-sama, how many people in this world have already become enlightened then?

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.740
I would say less than a hundred.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:13.380
Have you given up already?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:20.520
That means that we will be long gone by the time a million people ascend.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:23.020
Exactly, there's no way we can do it.

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:26.420
It makes no difference after all.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:32.480
Then why don't you try become the ascenders' forerunners?

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:37.400
Someone has to become one of those million ascenders.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:43.660
Otherwise, it doesn't mater how much time passes, this world will never ascend.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.460
Because it will be impossible during your generation?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.800
That might be true.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:54.160
But why don't you try to become a forerunner?

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:58.800
If no one does anything, then nothing will change.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:02.320
The most important thing for people is life.

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:04.900
And we only have one!

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.380
Before the end, when you look back at your life,

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:15.780
you don't want to think to yourself that you wasted it, that it was good-for-nothing and that you had no pride in your accomplishments.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:20.400
I want to be able to say that I gave it my everything.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:24.720
That I tackled the most important lesson that life has to give.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:29.860
Don't you think that's the kind of life you should be living?

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:39.580
It is true that I was born with <i>senen</i> so I don't understand the hardship of those who didn't.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:46.720
However, not everyone that has started down the enlightened path was born with talent.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:54.200
Even among the people that were born with <i>senen</i>, very few have actually managed to become enlightened.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:55.980
Now, think about this.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.760
Why did those people even train?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.760
For what reason?

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:08.060
Only they know the answer to those questions.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:16.720
All I can probably say is that they're proud of being the forerunners for the ascenders.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:25.640
These people by my side are all originally common folk and not enlightened.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:27.640
They're called masters.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:29.620
I ask you once more.

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.860
Do you want to become like these people?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.900
I do! I also want to become like them.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:35.720
Me too!

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:38.440
Me three! Please make one of them too.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.040
Me too!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.960
Me also!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.040
My child as well!

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:48.880
That sermon was pretty good.

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:49.960
I'm impressed.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.860
Pfft, it was a piece of cake.

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:53.860
The start, however, was so-so.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.740
What are we gonna do now?

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:56.860
Now we tax them.

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:57.740
Tax?

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:00.220
The Intelligence Tax.

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:29.360
Everyone's working really hard.

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:34.160
Buying all those artificial souls and distributing them for free payed off.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:46.940
Those who cannot naturally harness a soul to become enlightened must start by drinking this artificial soul for forty-five consecutive days.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.400
That way you are able to cultivate a soul faster.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:59.200
However, since this medicine is extremely expensive, it costs hundreds of thousands of magical stones per canister.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:04.120
Those funds were provided by the <i>houdan</i> that Oriku created.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:09.400
It's capable of transmuting eleven times per day, however, the amount of yang* particles varies.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:09.400
Yang: The positive side of Yin and Yang.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.940
Even then there were no funding problems.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:16.700
<i>Reidan</i>, <i>Reiden</i>, <i>Renkinjou</i>.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:20.120
We're making them start from the very beginning.

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:25.120
The only form of tax needed for them to manage this isthmus is manual labour.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.680
Well done, bureau director.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:31.000
In order to do business, you have to have a bird's-eye view of it.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.420
The way the Shichi school was doing it, it would immediately dry out.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.480
We have money and people.

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:38.740
What do we do now?

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.740
It's about time someone arrived.

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.260
Huh?

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:42.900
Someone?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:48.640
I've come from the Human Effort Temple with a an issue to discuss. Open the gate.

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:52.660
What are we discussing today?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.660
Where is the head?

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:58.660
Ah, he's dealing with a problem that requires his attention.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:00.700
I will be taking his place.

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.760
Hmm, very well.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:04.760
So, what is it that you wanted to discuss?

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:09.260
We received an official bill of indictment accusing the Shichi school to be heretical.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:16.520
We receive mountains of these kinds of bills of indictment every year.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.360
Usually we just brush them aside.

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:23.740
However, as part of the Human Effort Temple we couldn't simply ignore this one.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.740
And by that you mean...

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:30.160
The one who wrote it was one of the Reiken Sect's sacred disciples.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:32.160
The Reiken sect's...?

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:39.980
Even we can't completely ignore this since it does involve the Reiken sect.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:45.340
You understand, right?

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.160
Of course.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.860
And that's what's happening.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:18.020
Hey, you over there, come here.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:19.420
Whaaat!?!?

00:16:19.420 --> 00:16:23.500
You yourself are the founder of a heretic sect and still you complained about another heretic sect?!

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.020
What's wrong with that?

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.820
You might as well complain about yourself first then.

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.100
Yup...

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:35.600
Our great ideals and heresy are fundamentally different.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:42.680
According to a black market merchant, a large amount of dried aconite root has been brought into the village.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:50.340
And apparently who came to buy them was a bearded man with ruffled hair and a perverted look to him.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:53.120
Kotora, I'd like you to deliver something for me.

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:54.100
Understood.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.280
Do you have business with me?

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:07.710
Kain Elder

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:19.240
Was someone there?

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.500
Nope...

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:21.560
I see.

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:25.400
Oh, that's a pretty moon.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:31.700
Do you want to go to the watermill and do some training, seeing as it's such a hot night?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.220
Are you planning on going alone?

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:48.220
Yeah...

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:50.040
You're both <i>Chikki</i>, right?

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.680
Do you have any chances of winning?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.680
Hmm...

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:54.680
Shouldn't you tell the bureau director?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.760
Yeah...

00:17:56.780 --> 00:17:58.800
Wanna go again?

00:17:58.800 --> 00:17:59.800
Hmm...

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:01.800
Yes please!

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.800
The head is very angry...

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.020
Hmpf, I thought as much.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.380
I couldn't even imagine it.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:31.780
That you could betray us.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.240
It just happened.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.320
I'm sorry.

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:36.600
Where's the woman?

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:40.860
If you manage to defeat me it will only cause problems.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:44.020
But if I defeat you, it will all be settled.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.580
Why do you have to cause trouble.

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.580
I'm not so sure about that...

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:53.960
Don't take this personally!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.520
Are you not using a firearm?

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:08.740
When I bring you down I'll do it using my bare fists.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:18.100
Why, why did you betray us, brother?!

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.380
I'm not done yet!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.900
Yeah, I'm not like the kid I used to be.

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.900
This time it will go down differently.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:45.240
Hmpf, you inexperienced kid...

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.540
Why are you joining in on this guy's little act?

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.040
Like I said before, it just happened.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.880
Your history is also my history.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.780
And you just...

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:13.420
I already told you, it just happened.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:15.840
Don't bullsh*t me!

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:20.300
Is that all our time together is worth to you!?

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.720
My time is my own.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.720
It's not yours.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.640
What did you say?!

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:36.120
Your history is your own.

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:38.120
It's not mine.

00:20:39.660 --> 00:20:42.120
Don't you agree, you unexperienced child?

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:48.860
Is that... is that what you really thought?

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.260
Sto...

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:06.180
I'll never forgive you.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.420
Don't just stand there, help me carry him.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.600
Right away!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.390
Sorry about that, bother.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.520
I'm really sorry...

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:38.580
Hey, you'll catch a cold if you stay there.

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:49.020
The captive Shachi was forced to swallow a <i>reitan</i> stone produced by the A Million Chaos Ball.

00:21:49.260 --> 00:21:50.660
Shachi was told that...

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:55.680
What you were just given is a dissolvable poison pill.

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:59.560
If left alone, your cerebral nerves will melt and your spiritual power will disappear.

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:01.560
This was all a lie!

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.080
Luckily we have the antidote pill right here.

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:07.580
This was actually a cooked pillbug.

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.940
Welcome, to the Isthmus.
